#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'HELP'
Prefix: Ctrl+a
Alt+Enter / Alt+Shift+Enter  Split horizontally / vertically
Alt+arrows                  Move between panes
Alt+1..9                    Select window
Ctrl+1..9                   Select session by creation order
Ctrl+Alt+Left/Right          Previous/next window
Ctrl+Alt+Up/Down             Previous/next session
Prefix+C                    Project/session picker
Prefix+S                    Session/window tree
Prefix+e / Prefix+E          Agent sidebar here / everywhere
Prefix+q                    Reload config
Prefix+Space                Copy mode (vi keys; v select, y copy)
Prefix+x / k / K            Close pane / window / session
Last pane closes            Exit this tmux client, leave other sessions alone
HELP
